<p>Control your movements to increase your defenses. This allows you to shrug off minor damage and, if you have a shield equipped, preemptively Block in reaction to incoming damage.  </p><p>While this talent is activated, you are globally slowed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">17%, 12%, 9.5%, 7.7%, 6.4%</acronym> and all damage you take is reduced by a flat <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Dexterity 100,<br>Luck 100">9.6, 13, 16, 18, 20.</acronym></p><p>If you have a shield equipped and Block is not on cooldown, any blockable damage that is greater than 33% of your block value (before resistances) will have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">17%, 24%, 29%, 32%, 36%</acronym> chance to instantly activate Block.</p><p>The flat damage reduction will increase with your defense.</p>